Application **26/01297/PPP** relates to land north of Kirk Brae and proposes four houses (planning in principle). According to our records, it has already been **decided: refused**, on 9 September 2026. The consultation period is closed, so no further comments can be submitted on it.

Because it was refused, the applicant could appeal or submit a new application. If a new application is made, you would normally be notified as a neighbour and could comment then. If you'd like to know the reasons for refusal or the decision notice, please contact the planning desk directly, quoting the reference, and they can send you the full decision documents.
